{"title":{"en":"Scots Pine","de":"Waldkiefer"},"summary":{"en":"A mature Scots pine (Pinus sylvestris) of about 22 m: a straight, bare bole with grey-brown plated bark below and thin, flaking orange bark above, carrying a high, flat-topped, irregular crown of horizontal needle plates on a few widely spaced limbs; dead branch stubs remain on the lower bole.","de":"Eine ausgewachsene Waldkiefer (Pinus sylvestris) von etwa 22 m: gerader, astfreier Schaft mit graubrauner Plattenborke unten und dünner, abblätternder oranger Rinde oben, der eine hohe, schirmförmige, unregelmäßige Krone aus waagerechten Nadelplatten auf wenigen weit gestellten Ästen trägt; am unteren Schaft bleiben tote Aststummel."},"tags":["tree","evergreen","conifer","flat-crown","wind","transpiration"],"provenance":{"author":"Semio staffage vegetation content worker","method":"handcrafted","created":"2026-10-29","references":[{"id":"wood-handbook-2021","citation":"Forest Products Laboratory (2021). Wood Handbook: Wood as an Engineering Material. General Technical Report FPL-GTR-282, USDA Forest Service. Chapter 5 (green density, modulus of elasticity and rupture; closest listed species used as proxy)."},{"id":"en-1991-1-4","citation":"EN 1991-1-4:2005 Eurocode 1, Actions on structures, Part 1-4: Wind actions. Air density 1.25 kg/m3, F = 0.5 rho cd A v^2, peak velocity pressure (1 + 7 Iv) q_m."},{"id":"en-1991-1-3","citation":"EN 1991-1-3:2003 Eurocode 1, Actions on structures, Part 1-3: Snow loads. Used for the order of magnitude of snow and ice accretion (about 10 kg/m2 on plan area)."},{"id":"mayhead-1973","citation":"Mayhead, G. J. (1973). Some drag coefficients for British forest trees derived from wind tunnel studies. Agricultural Meteorology 12, 123-130."},{"id":"koerner-1979","citation":"Koerner, C., Scheel, J. A. and Bauer, H. (1979). Maximum leaf diffusive conductance in vascular plants. Photosynthetica 13(1), 45-82."},{"id":"jones-2014","citation":"Jones, H. G. (2014). Plants and Microclimate, 3rd ed., Cambridge University Press. Leaf energy balance, leaf area index, boundary-layer conductance."},{"id":"monteith-unsworth-2013","citation":"Monteith, J. L. and Unsworth, M. H. (2013). Principles of Environmental Physics, 4th ed., Academic Press. Penman-Monteith leaf transpiration."},{"id":"pretzsch-2015","citation":"Pretzsch, H., Biber, P., Uhl, E. et al. (2015). Crown size and growing space requirement of common tree species in urban centres, parks, and forests. Urban Forestry and Urban Greening 14(3), 466-479."}],"notes":{"en":"Plates, limbs and the two-tone bole are authored by hand after a 100-year-old open-grown pine; the crown starts at 12 m. Masses are volume times green density (Pinus sylvestris, Wood Handbook proxy) plus needle and twig estimates. Winter-bare geometry does not apply to an evergreen; poses are calm, fresh breeze, gale and snow-laden plates.","de":"Platten, Äste und der zweifarbige Schaft sind von Hand nach einer 100-jährigen Solitärkiefer gezeichnet; die Krone beginnt in 12 m Höhe. Massen sind Volumen mal Frischholzdichte (Pinus sylvestris, Wood-Handbook-Proxy) plus Nadel- und Reisigschätzungen. Eine winterkahle Geometrie entfällt bei einem Immergrünen; die Posen sind Ruhe, frische Brise, Sturm und schneebeladene Platten."}},"dimensions":{"heightM":22.2,"widthM":12.2,"depthM":8,"massKg":2800},"materials":[{"id":"pine-bark-lower","title":{"en":"Grey-brown plated bark","de":"Graubraune Plattenborke"},"emissivity":0.95,"solarAbsorptivity":0.8,"densityKgM3":520,"conductivityWmK":0.12,"source":"authored-estimate","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"pine-bark-upper","title":{"en":"Thin orange flaking bark","de":"Dünne orange Spiegelrinde"},"emissivity":0.93,"solarAbsorptivity":0.55,"densityKgM3":450,"conductivityWmK":0.1,"source":"authored-estimate","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"pine-needles-sun","title":{"en":"Pine needles, sunlit plates","de":"Kiefernnadeln, besonnte Platten"},"emissivity":0.97,"solarAbsorptivity":0.5,"source":"literature","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"pine-needles-shade","title":{"en":"Pine needles, lower shaded plates","de":"Kiefernnadeln, untere beschattete Platten"},"emissivity":0.97,"solarAbsorptivity":0.28,"source":"authored-estimate","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"pine-wood","title":{"en":"Green pine wood","de":"Frisches Kiefernholz"},"emissivity":0.9,"solarAbsorptivity":0.6,"densityKgM3":850,"conductivityWmK":0.14,"elasticModulusPa":6900000000.0,"strengthPa":42000000.0,"source":"literature","reference":"wood-handbook-2021"}],"poses":[{"id":"calm","title":{"en":"Calm summer day","de":"Windstiller Sommertag"},"description":{"en":"Light air of 1.5 m/s at 10 m: the bole stands vertical and the plates are at rest; drag per plate is 6 to 8 N.","de":"Leiser Zug von 1,5 m/s in 10 m Höhe: Der Schaft steht senkrecht, die Platten ruhen; der Widerstand je Platte beträgt 6 bis 8 N."},"bones":{"pl-top":{"angleDeg":0.3},"pl-w1":{"angleDeg":-0.3}},"ground":"authored","contacts":[],"thermal":{"operating":{},"emitters":{"transpiration-top":0.8,"transpiration-w":0.8}},"loads":[{"id":"wind-pl-w3","kind":"wind","title":{"en":"Wind drag on needle plate, lower west","de":"Winddruck auf Nadelplatte unten West"},"bone":"pl-w3","x":0.5,"y":0,"fxN":6.0,"fyN":0,"source":"literature","reference":"en-1991-1-4"},
